      "code": "def edit_distance(a, b):\n    if len(a) < len(b):\n        a, b = b, a\n    previous = list(range(len(b) + 1))\n    for i, ca in enumerate(a, 1):\n        current = [i]\n        for j, cb in enumerate(b, 1):\n            current.append(min(\n                previous[j] + 1,\n                current[j - 1] + 1,\n                previous[j - 1] + (ca != cb),\n            ))\n        previous = current\n    return previous[-1]",
